title: Military Concerns
view-if: violence_level >= 50 and schleicher_plot != "successful" and spd_in_government and spd_bd_position != "support_kpd"
on-arrival: military_weariness += 15
max-visits: 1
new-page: true
tags: event

= A message from Schleicher

Dear SPD, if you do not lock in, I WILL use the military for evil purposes. (Violence high)

Do something.

But personalyyyyy, if you work with me I will get the far right to decrease violence (I am lying)

Love Schleicher

- @bide: By giving the military some concessions we can delay their action.
- @work: Maybe we can hear him out.
- @accelerate: The best way to reduce violence, is to kill the violent.

@bide
choose-if: budget > 0 and military_concessions < 5
subtitle: [? if military_concessions == 5 : If we give them anymore concessions, we will get couped. ?] [? if military_concessions == 1 : -1 budget ?] [? if military_concessions == 3 : -2 budget ?] [? if budget < 1 : We are BROKE. ?]
on-arrival: military_concessions += 1; budget -=1 if military_concessions == 0; budget -= 2 if military_concessions == 2; {!

if (Q.military_concessions == 1) {
    Q.reichswehr_loyalty += 0.05;
    Q.workers_spd -= 3;
    Q.unemployed_spd -= 3;
    Q.workers_nsdap += 3;
    Q.unemployed_kpd += 3;
    Q.month_actions += 1;
}

if (Q.military_concessions == 2) {
    Q.reichswehr_loyalty += 0.4;
    Q.budget -= 1;
    Q.reichswehr_strength += 100;
    Q.left_dissent += 10;
    Q.month_actions += 1;
}

if (Q.military_concessions == 3) {
    Q.reichswehr_loyalty += 0.25;
    Q.rb_dissent += 25;
    Q.month_actions += 1;
}

if (Q.military_concessions == 4) {
    Q.reichswehr_loyalty += 0.4;
    Q.budget -= 2;
    Q.reichswehr_militancy += 1;
    Q.reichswehr_strength += 200;
    Q.left_dissent += 25;
    Q.month_actions += 1;
}

if (Q.military_concessions == 5) {
    Q.reichswehr_loyalty += 0.3;
    Q.rb_dissent = 100;
    Q.month_actions += 1;
}

!}

[? if military_concessions == 1 : We promise the army to fund them once this is over. A vague promise of future military funding. It buys us time, but at the cost of slight credibility. ?]

[? if military_concessions == 2 : We allocate a part of their budget to placate them. The left our party are irritated. They cite it shows weakness, and could start a trend of once again, going to the military for help.?]

[? if military_concessions == 3 : We can delegate some of our paramilitary suppression operations to the Reichswehr. The Reichsbanner are untrusting of the Reichswehr, yet for now at least, most tolerate their presence.?]

[? if military_concessions == 4 : We can allocate a large portion of our budget on militarizing the Reichswehr even further. The left's fear have only grown worse, with many hardliners leaving the party and joining the KPD! Many in the party are starting to doubt our actions. ?]

[? if military_concessions == 5 : We can give up major positions on anti streetfighting operations. The Reichsbanner are absolutely pissed ?]


@work
subtitle: not finished but if military influence too high ts will be the only option
view-if: military_influence >= 75
on-arrival: military_weariness += 15; violence_add_on += 6

The military has forced our hand. We have no choice but to work with them, their influence has spread not just to government, but in our party as well.


AHHHHHHHHHh

@accelerate
choose-if: military_influence < 75
subtitle: We must accelerate our efforts. Schleicher might be a little angry [? if military_influence >= 75 :  The Military has far too much influence within our party. ?]
on-arrival: violence_add_on += 6; military_weariness += 10; z_relation -= 20

We must accelerate our efforts to reduce the violence in the streets. Although our response being "more killing" does not reassure the military.